==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|bronchus|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|βρόγχος|tr=bronkhos||windpipe|lang=grc}} + {{term|-itis|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|pl2=bronchitides|-}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} An [[inflammation]] of the [[bronchus|bronchi]] of the [[lung]]s, that causes the [[cilia]] of the bronchial epithelial cells to stop functioning.
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} An occurrence of, a case (patient) of, or a type of bronchitis.

